      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4274f74b6c4b431dce4c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Bucket** - Bucket aggregations don't calculate metrics, they create buckets of documents based on field values, ranges and a variety of other criteria. Refer to [Bucket aggregations](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-aggregations-bucket.html) for additional information. Use bucket aggregations under `Group by` when creating a metrics query in the query builder.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch query editor",
        "Aggregation types"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d0f25c1cab3b4fcd5e05cce9a8f8cfccaf17ea0b",
        "sha256": "dba24f1ec9d38a3676186d27734a8a1f8ecc07be9c656f1bfb2293dcf907c726",
        "lineStart": 42,
        "lineEnd": 42,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/query-editor/index.md#L42-L42"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad81f3ac330eb102a709",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Metrics** - Metrics aggregations perform calculations such as sum, average, min, etc. They can be single-value or multi-value. Refer to [Metrics aggregations](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-aggregations-metrics.html) for additional information. Use metrics aggregations in the metrics query type in the query builder.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch query editor",
        "Aggregation types"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d0f25c1cab3b4fcd5e05cce9a8f8cfccaf17ea0b",
        "sha256": "dba24f1ec9d38a3676186d27734a8a1f8ecc07be9c656f1bfb2293dcf907c726",
        "lineStart": 44,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/query-editor/index.md#L44-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b393f7252dd31a9f09f1",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Pipeline** - Pipeline aggregations work on the output of other aggregations rather than on documents or fields. Refer to [Pipeline aggregations](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-aggregations-pipeline.html) for additional information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch query editor",
        "Aggregation types"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d0f25c1cab3b4fcd5e05cce9a8f8cfccaf17ea0b",
