      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you select the **Metrics** query type, ES|QL also accepts the `PROMQL` source command. Grafana processes the response as time series frames, the same way it does for ES|QL `STATS` queries. `PROMQL` must be the first command in the query (leading comments are allowed):",
