    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.43c0228ee1501b049f76",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Whenever you change the value of the `$environment` variable via the drop-down, Grafana triggers an update of the `$host` variable to contain only hostnames filtered by the selected environment.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Use variables in queries",
        "Chain or nest variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.28fe2ef12fd8b79149fe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use variables in bucket aggregation fields to dynamically change how data is grouped. For example, use a variable in the **Terms** group by field to let users switch between grouping by `hostname`, `service`, or `datacenter`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Use variables in queries",
        "Variables in aggregations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 84,
        "lineEnd": 84,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L84-L84"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2db12d92b1dfdb2da042",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the above example, a Lucene query filters documents based on the `hostname` property using a variable named `$hostname`. The example also uses a variable in the _Terms_ group by field input box, which you can use to quickly change how data is grouped.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Template variable examples"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 90,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L90-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.13b91a5fefa5b6c855f9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Write the query using a custom JSON string, with the field mapped as a [keyword](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/keyword.html#keyword) in the Elasticsearch index mapping.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L95-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1abef112477744b33345",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the query is [multi-field](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/multi-fields.html) with both a `text` and `keyword` type, use `\"field\":\"fieldname.keyword\"` (sometimes `fieldname.raw`) to specify the keyword field in your query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
