    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4da98521a72df81ac2cd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Queries of `terms` have a 500-result limit by default. To set a custom limit, set the `size` property in your query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 109,
        "lineEnd": 109,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L109-L109"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad2ad033afa6cb32c229",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, queries return results in term order (which can then be sorted alphabetically or numerically using the variable's Sort setting).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query",
        "Sort query results"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 113,
        "lineEnd": 113,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L113-L113"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2c431728539715c969c0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To produce a list of terms sorted by document count (a top-N values list), add an `orderBy` property of `doc_count`. This automatically selects a descending sort:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query",
        "Sort query results"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 115,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L115-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5f686ebe351e10cfd07e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also use the `order` property to explicitly set ascending or descending sort:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query",
        "Sort query results"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
        "lineStart": 121,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md#L121-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cac49693c00ca99a2e5f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Elasticsearch [discourages](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-aggregations-bucket-terms-aggregation.html#search-aggregations-bucket-terms-aggregation-order) sorting by ascending doc count because it can return inaccurate results.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Elasticsearch template variables",
        "Create a query",
        "Sort query results"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/elasticsearch/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c012647e7759d96e5f77baac5a53314e5de12192",
        "sha256": "24ea866c6f3169bf197dec1528bb83dde5674dd9baff3689bc0c32da39e942b5",
