      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Google Cloud Monitoring data source supports [Grafana-managed recording rules](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/). Recording rules periodically pre-compute frequently used or computationally expensive queries, saving the results as a new time series metric.",
