      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Native events:** There's no support for displaying Google Cloud Monitoring's native annotations and events. However, annotations work well with [custom metrics](https://cloud.google.com/monitoring/custom-metrics/) in Google Cloud Monitoring.",
