    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.751a3e48c40150c742d7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you change the scopes, each user must sign out, revoke the existing grant at [https://myaccount.google.com/permissions](https://myaccount.google.com/permissions), and sign in again. Google reuses the previous consent until the grant is revoked, so existing sessions continue to hold tokens issued under the old scope set.",
