      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Configure your Grafana Cloud stack's SSO integration against the same OIDC provider, so the signed-in user's identity is available for Grafana Cloud to exchange for a Google Cloud access token before the request reaches the plugin. Refer to [Configure OAuth2 authentication](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/) for setup details.",
