        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.257b770f1d24ad9373cc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the **Group By** segment to group resource or metric labels, which reduces the number of time series and aggregates the results by group.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Group time series",
        "Group by"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 105,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L105-L105"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.776a254e56636c91d800",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you group by `instance_name`, Grafana displays an aggregated metric for the specified Compute instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Group time series",
        "Group by"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 107,
        "lineEnd": 107,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L107-L107"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d4a2ed57a18df9d68263",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Resource metadata labels contain information that can uniquely identify a resource in Google Cloud. A time series response returns metadata labels only if they're part of the Group By segment in the time series request.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Group time series",
        "Group by",
        "Metadata labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 111,
        "lineEnd": 112,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L111-L112"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e11f360a5cf468ad61d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There's no API for retrieving metadata labels, so you can't populate the Group By list with the metadata labels that are available for the selected service and metric. However, the **Group By** field list comes with a pre-defined set of common system labels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Group time series",
        "Group by",
        "Metadata labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 114,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L114-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9e40279d753dda8d65a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can't pre-define user labels, but you can enter them manually in the **Group By** field. If you include a metadata label, user label, or system label in the **Group By** segment, you can create filters based on it and expand its value on the **Alias** field.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Group time series",
        "Group by",
        "Metadata labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 117,
        "lineEnd": 118,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L117-L118"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.50844605c9edc8a09508",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To combine the time series in the group into a single time series, select a grouping function.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Group time series",
        "Group by function"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 122,
        "lineEnd": 122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L122-L122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.be55f3612654d8b6516b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can align all data points received in a fixed length of time by applying an alignment function to combine those data points, and then assigning a timestamp to the result.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Align data"
      ],
      "source": {
