    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e1320a1eec968fc9b13",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can click on a time series in the panel to access a context menu, which contains a link to **View in Metrics Explorer in Google Cloud Console**. The link points to the Google Cloud Console's Metrics Explorer and runs the Grafana panel's query there.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Deep-link from Grafana panels to the Google Cloud Console Metrics Explorer"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 196,
        "lineEnd": 197,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L196-L197"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.390d0359df803ad1c0d5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you select the link, you first select an account in the Google Account Chooser. Google then redirects you to the Metrics Explorer.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Deep-link from Grafana panels to the Google Cloud Console Metrics Explorer"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 199,
        "lineEnd": 200,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L199-L200"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7fa1bf64850529a7d7e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The provided link is valid for any account, but displays the query only if your account has access to the query's specified GCP project.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Deep-link from Grafana panels to the Google Cloud Console Metrics Explorer"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 202,
        "lineEnd": 202,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L202-L202"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.95a0155fef516f7ca0b7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana issues one query to the Cloud Monitoring API per query editor row, and each API response includes a unit. Grafana attempts to convert the returned unit into a unit compatible with its time series panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Understand automatic unit detection"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 206,
        "lineEnd": 207,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L206-L207"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0406846f9e42cd664dc9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If successful, Grafana displays the unit on the panel's Y-axis. If the query editor rows return different units, Grafana uses the unit from the last query editor row in the time series panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Understand automatic unit detection"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35f2bbc8926a6d131f4d3cbcb6a6184dabccd704",
        "sha256": "5bd24c0a5753f11d9c5d6296eadff38bbc9734793a5e4cc55da2cb6fe1d87ef1",
        "lineStart": 209,
        "lineEnd": 210,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md#L209-L210"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.779ab9d442eae75187d5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Monitoring Query Language (MQL) query builder helps you query and display MQL results in time series format. To understand basic MQL concepts, refer to [Introduction to Monitoring Query Language](https://cloud.google.com/monitoring/mql).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Google Cloud Monitoring query editor",
        "Query metrics",
        "Use the Monitoring Query Language"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/query-editor/index.md",
