      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify the Grafana Google authentication includes the `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/monitoring.read` scope. Refer to [Configure the Google OAuth scope](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/google-cloud-monitoring/google-authentication/#configure-the-google-oauth-scope).",
      "headingPath": [
