      "sourceText": "Once you've added the Graphite data source, you can [configure it](#configure-the-data-source) so that your Grafana instance's users can create queries in its [query editor](query-editor/) when they [build dashboards](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/build-dashboards/) and use [Explore](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/).",
