      "sourceText": "Grafana exposes metrics for Graphite on the `/metrics` endpoint. Refer to [Internal Grafana metrics](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-monitoring/) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Graphite data source",
        "Get Grafana metrics into Graphite"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/graphite/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "559db3a126c603e14250c54eefeab6ee448b442d",
        "sha256": "5f5258afd816e604f5fc2e0984c450e868f5efc282f42e9657f02f006929fc30",
        "lineStart": 36,
        "lineEnd": 37,
