    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f0a16c1238649c4944c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Series** - A series in Graphite is a unique time-series dataset, represented by a specific metric name and timestamped values. Click **select metric** to select a metric from the drop-down.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Graphite query editor",
        "Query editor elements"
      ],
      "source": {
