    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.96ae344135f74a670363",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Functions** - Graphite uses functions to manipulate data. Click the **+ sign** to view a list of functions in the drop-down. You can create a query with multiple functions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Graphite query editor",
