    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fa88519fce6e8f5157a7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use multiple filter expressions, and those expressions can include other Grafana variables. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Graphite template variables",
        "Use tag variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/graphite/template-variables/index.md",
