      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If evaluations fail because queries run out of time, increase the data source timeout. Refer to [Advanced HTTP settings](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/influxdb/configure/#advanced-http-settings) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "InfluxDB alerting",
        "Handle transient errors and timeouts"
