      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're unsure which InfluxDB product you're using, refer to InfluxData's [InfluxDB product detection tool](https://docs.influxdata.com/influxdb3/enterprise/visualize-data/grafana/) for guidance.",
