      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Complete the required connection settings and click **Save & test** before you rename the data source. If you rename a new data source before saving it, Grafana validates the entire configuration and returns an error because the **URL** field is still empty.",
