      "id": "grafana.candidate.87a066ddbe9136b0d7ab",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **URL** - The HTTP protocol, IP address, and port of your InfluxDB API. The InfluxDB default API port is `8086`. When you enter a URL, Grafana attempts to auto-detect your InfluxDB product based on URL patterns. Refer to [InfluxDB detection](https://docs.influxdata.com/influxdb3/enterprise/visualize-data/grafana/) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the InfluxDB data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "URL and authentication"
      ],
