      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Flux** - Flux is a data scripting language developed by InfluxData that allows you to query, analyze, and act on data. Refer to [Get started with Flux](https://docs.influxdata.com/influxdb/cloud/query-data/get-started/) for guidance on using Flux.",
