      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "_For InfluxQL only._ **Database + Retention Policy (DBRP) Mapping** must be configured before data can be queried for the following products: _InfluxDB OSS 1.x_, _InfluxDB OSS 2.x_, _InfluxDB Enterprise 1.x_, _InfluxDB Cloud (TSM)_, _InfluxDB Cloud Serverless_.",
