    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1617ca631591834fb8a8",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Max series** - Sets a limit on the maximum number of series or tables that Grafana processes. Set a lower limit to prevent system overload, or increase it if you have many small time series and need to display more of them. The default is `1000`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the InfluxDB data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Database settings",
        "Advanced database settings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/configure/_index.md",
