    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a46d6e439e35fa2415be",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **HTTP method** - Sets the HTTP method used to query your data source. The POST method allows for larger queries that would return an error using the GET method. The default method is `POST`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the InfluxDB data source",
        "Configuration options",
