    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f7e5611ad6f4fbb5744e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you use PDC, don't set the InfluxDB URL to `127.0.0.1` or `localhost`. PDC tunnels traffic through a SOCKS proxy, which can't resolve loopback addresses. Use the machine's LAN IP address or a hostname that's resolvable from the network where the PDC agent runs. Refer to [PDC connection fails with \"no such host\"](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/#pdc-connection-fails-with-no-such-host) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the InfluxDB data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Private data source connect"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/configure/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e51cddd49bb025d09e0c040e81db0826e6f05d",
        "sha256": "eeb01a12d09a560072df50f6acfd13eb93181c39670772e30c9df0d2d7eb79ee",
        "lineStart": 225,
        "lineEnd": 225,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/configure/_index.md#L225-L225"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.800e807a9077953ecd6d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "PDC agent deployment, proxy configuration, and network and token management are covered in the PDC documentation, not here. Refer to [Configure PDC](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/configure-pdc/) for setup and [Troubleshoot PDC issues](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/troubleshooting/) for agent errors, log interpretation, and failure modes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the InfluxDB data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Private data source connect"
      ],
      "source": {
