      "sourceText": "Grafana supports Flux when running InfluxDB v1.8 and higher. If your data source is [configured for Flux](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/influxdb/configure/), you can use the [Flux](https://docs.influxdata.com/flux/v0/) in the query editor, which serves as a text editor for raw Flux queries with macro support.",
