      "sourceText": "You can query and display log data from InfluxDB in [Explore](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/) and in the dashboard [Logs panel](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/visualizations/logs/).",
