    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2f5ea65a64d8f747c78e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, metadata queries such as `SHOW TAG VALUES` return values from the entire retention period, not just the dashboard time range. If a host or sensor stopped reporting long ago, its values still appear in the variable drop-down as long as they exist within retention.",
      "headingPath": [
        "InfluxDB template variables",
        "Scope variables to the dashboard time range"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "456916b3c3ccdcf5700d556ce2f5c5e2f7dccd09",
        "sha256": "63605f8531159590ecf2f6daa156138b85929443decbf41c686a992f89d7d747",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md#L116-L116"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1fd6d7032eb6bae82e45",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Include a time condition in the variable query. Variable queries interpolate the same time macros as regular queries: `$timeFilter` for InfluxQL, `$__timeFilter(<column>)` for SQL, and `v.timeRangeStart` and `v.timeRangeStop` for Flux.",
      "headingPath": [
        "InfluxDB template variables",
        "Scope variables to the dashboard time range"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "456916b3c3ccdcf5700d556ce2f5c5e2f7dccd09",
        "sha256": "63605f8531159590ecf2f6daa156138b85929443decbf41c686a992f89d7d747",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md#L120-L120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3f8b03279fa20a6422fe",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set the variable's **Refresh** option to **On time range change** so the values update when the dashboard time range changes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "InfluxDB template variables",
        "Scope variables to the dashboard time range"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md",
