    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9c126c8ee600c8b9ce01",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you have a variable named `region`, you can configure the `hosts` variable to display only hosts from the selected region.",
      "headingPath": [
        "InfluxDB template variables",
        "Chain or nest variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md",
