    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d92662065e3df8279f70",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The InfluxDB data source supports two variable syntaxes for use in the **Query** field:",
      "headingPath": [
        "InfluxDB template variables",
        "Choose a variable syntax"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/index.md",
