    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b978570f38e8fa91f336",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The PDC agent uses a Grafana Cloud API token to periodically renew its SSH certificate. If the token is incorrect, has expired, or has been deleted, certificate renewal fails and the connection stops working when the current certificate expires.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connection stops working after certificate renewal fails"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
