    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.45ec0accedd8dad80ea0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Metadata queries such as `SHOW TAG VALUES` return values from the entire retention period, not just the dashboard time range. Hosts or sensors that stopped reporting long ago still appear in the drop-down.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Variable drop-down shows stale or historical values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 500,
        "lineEnd": 500,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L500-L500"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.037283a6f5fc532d7270",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Add a time condition to the variable query, such as `WHERE $timeFilter` for InfluxQL or `WHERE $__timeFilter(time)` for SQL.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Variable drop-down shows stale or historical values"
      ],
      "source": {
