    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.125d9dcf7c29ad3aa229",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** When a variable has the **Multi-value** or **Include all value** option enabled, Grafana interpolates the selected values as a regular expression group, such as `(server1|server2)`. Queries that compare with `=` or that don't wrap the variable in a regular expression fail or return no data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Multi-select variable breaks the query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 510,
        "lineEnd": 510,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L510-L510"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.17b2c94e362af9ccae1e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For InfluxQL, use the `=~` operator and wrap the variable in a regular expression: `\"hostname\" =~ /^$host$/`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Multi-select variable breaks the query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 514,
        "lineEnd": 514,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L514-L514"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.42bf9568bd71fcf7d856",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For SQL, use the `IN` operator: `host IN ($host)`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Multi-select variable breaks the query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
