    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5db5fe9b9d0db76d6297",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Refer to [Choose a variable syntax](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/#choose-a-variable-syntax) for working examples.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Multi-select variable breaks the query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
