    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.abc3dd04d29eff1ed798",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Grafana escapes special characters in variable values when the variable is multi-value or used inside a regular expression. Custom variable values that intentionally contain special characters, such as paths or expressions, arrive at InfluxDB modified.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Variable values are escaped unexpectedly"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 520,
        "lineEnd": 520,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L520-L520"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2632a323a86ba769cd23",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the `raw` format option, such as `${path:raw}`, to interpolate the literal value without escaping. Refer to [Prevent unwanted value escaping](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/influxdb/template-variables/#prevent-unwanted-value-escaping) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Variable values are escaped unexpectedly"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 524,
        "lineEnd": 524,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L524-L524"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.46a8123cae8f30c31e1a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The variable query returns duplicate values. Grafana deduplicates results, but depending on the plugin version, duplicates can surface as a blank entry in the drop-down.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Template variable errors",
        "Variable drop-down contains a blank or duplicate entry"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
