      "id": "grafana.candidate.eabd02fcb318e53d88c4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Dashboard panels reference an old or deleted data source UID. This happens when a data source is deleted and recreated, since the new data source gets a different UID. Dashboard schema migrations can also leave panels with invalid data source references, so verify your panels after a dashboard is migrated to a new schema version.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "\"Data source was not found\""
      ],
      "source": {
