    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.441d3689d9f77e18a08f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** InfluxDB sets a field's data type when the field is first written. If numeric values were written as strings, for example quoted in line protocol, InfluxDB returns them as strings and Grafana can't graph them. This is a data issue in InfluxDB, not in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Numeric values stored as strings display a blank panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 587,
        "lineEnd": 587,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L587-L587"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1fe1b03b61214af5127d",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. As a workaround, add the [Convert field type](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/#convert-field-type) transformation to the panel and convert the field to **Number**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Numeric values stored as strings display a blank panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 591,
        "lineEnd": 591,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L591-L591"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.48f06e6d5ec1c6cd7902",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. To fix the root cause, correct the data type at write time. InfluxDB can't change the type of an existing field, so you may need to write the data to a new field or measurement.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Numeric values stored as strings display a blank panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 592,
        "lineEnd": 592,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L592-L592"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.666a9c4291514bf0771a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In older Grafana versions, the **Convert field type** transformation converted null values to zeros. Current versions preserve null values. If you see nulls displayed as zeros after conversion, upgrade Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Numeric values stored as strings display a blank panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 593,
        "lineEnd": 593,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L593-L593"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0b80f33e22c6ead017a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Grafana calculates the query interval (`$__interval`) from the time range and the maximum number of data points, which is based on the panel's width. A panel rendered in edit mode has a different width than in the dashboard view, so queries that group by `time($__interval)` can aggregate into different bucket sizes and display different values. Both results are correct. They're aggregated at different resolutions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Panel values differ between view and edit mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 597,
        "lineEnd": 597,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L597-L597"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b36e2b63a9c06c04e772",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. To make values consistent, set a fixed **Min interval** or **Max data points** value in the panel's query options.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Panel values differ between view and edit mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 601,
        "lineEnd": 601,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L601-L601"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e72507581a3ec3201896",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Alternatively, use an explicit interval in the query, such as `GROUP BY time(1m)` instead of `GROUP BY time($__interval)`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Panel values differ between view and edit mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
