    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6f3a4c5d564a8956ab6c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The query returns multiple series with the same name. This commonly happens when a query doesn't group by the tags that differentiate series, or when an alias hides the distinguishing information. Grafana assigns colors and tooltip values by series name, so duplicate names cause the legend and hover tooltip to display mismatched colors or values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Legend or tooltip colors don't match the series"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4a7b13c358eecf6574d0997b79ec479ac54c4614",
        "sha256": "6a85994bf5cb19181f9a7ca1e07ab58a83c1bedff4e31bc2c8599e06058793c5",
        "lineStart": 606,
        "lineEnd": 606,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md#L606-L606"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.89b1b6aa8c125c1d1a72",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Group by the tags that make each series unique, such as `GROUP BY \"hostname\"`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot InfluxDB data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Legend or tooltip colors don't match the series"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/influxdb/troubleshooting/index.md",
