      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In Grafana Enterprise and Grafana Cloud, enable [query caching](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/data-source-management/#query-and-resource-caching) so identical queries within the cache window are served from cache instead of hitting InfluxDB.",
