    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.926cc9b05379eb61cb45",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana ships with the Jaeger data source preinstalled in both Grafana OSS and Enterprise, so there's nothing to install. It's packaged as a standalone plugin that updates independently of Grafana releases. For more information, refer to [Plugin updates](#plugin-updates).",
