      "id": "grafana.candidate.e08ea865625414c869b2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you run Grafana 12.3.x through 13.1.x, you can install the standalone plugin from the plugin catalog to get the latest features before you upgrade to Grafana 13.2. To use the standalone plugin with these versions, add the following to your [configuration file](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/):",
      "headingPath": [
