    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23537f9ca9574a273123",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Data source-managed alert rules:** The Loki ruler stores and evaluates the rule. Use these when you want alert rules to live alongside your Loki deployment. Enable **Manage alert rules in Alerting UI** on the data source to create and edit them from Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki alerting"
