      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Secure Socks Proxy** settings appear only when the secure SOCKS data source proxy is enabled in the Grafana configuration file. When enabled, you can route data source requests through a secure SOCKS proxy. For more information, refer to [Configure a data source connection proxy](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/).",
