      "sourceText": "To manage other alerting resources, such as the alerts these rules generate, add an [Alertmanager data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/alertmanager/). For more information on alerting with Loki, refer to [Loki alerting](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/loki/alerting/).",
