    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1e0404a58d97b173607f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Type** - Selects the query type to run. The `instant` type queries against a single point in time, using the **To** time from the time range. The `range` type queries over the selected range of time.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki query editor",
        "Options"
      ],
