      "id": "grafana.candidate.0fb7f8562f50517626dc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A log query has two parts: a stream selector that chooses log streams by label, and an optional pipeline that filters and parses the matching lines. Replace the label matchers with values from your own logs.",
