    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c291d5914300a567d1a6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Use case: debug a failing service.** Combine a namespace and app selector with a parser and label filter to isolate the errors for one service during an incident:",
