      "id": "grafana.candidate.2f8d94994b9717074145",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you use reverse proxies, configure them accordingly to use live tailing:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki query editor",
        "Create a log query",
        "Tail live logs",
        "Proxying examples"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/query-editor/index.md",
