    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8d54d937444112e8cb3d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a variable has **Multi-value** or **Include All** enabled, Grafana joins the selected values into a regular expression, such as `payments|checkout`. Use the regular expression match operator `=~` so the query matches any of the selected values:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki template variables",
        "Use query variables",
        "Query variable example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md",
