    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1786809e9f76c728e9fb",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A **Multi-value** or **Include All** variable has each value escaped for use in a regular expression and joined with `|`, for example `payments|checkout`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki template variables",
        "Format variable values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md",
