    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.52203075be9c77de8eac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, to use a raw custom value in an exact-match selector:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki template variables",
        "Format variable values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md",
