    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dae0eda3d250a880d0e9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Loki supports ad hoc filters. Use them to specify any number of key/value filters that Grafana applies automatically to all of your Loki queries, without editing each query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki template variables",
        "Use ad hoc filters"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bb6baccf3a16af879e02b220ff1c17064cb076ad",
        "sha256": "8193ee3d90cd1d5362b211957442b2274d69f01aad93e856b37b83baf82c751e",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c442497cf56176b2841d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you add an ad hoc filter for `level = error`, Grafana appends the matcher to the stream selector of every Loki query on the dashboard, so a query like `{app=\"payments\"}` runs as `{app=\"payments\", level=\"error\"}`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki template variables",
        "Use ad hoc filters"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bb6baccf3a16af879e02b220ff1c17064cb076ad",
        "sha256": "8193ee3d90cd1d5362b211957442b2274d69f01aad93e856b37b83baf82c751e",
        "lineStart": 94,
        "lineEnd": 94,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md#L94-L94"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.57b9a91441a2bba22fed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information, refer to [Add ad hoc filters](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/variables/add-template-variables/#add-ad-hoc-filters).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Loki template variables",
        "Use ad hoc filters"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/loki/template-variables/index.md",
