      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| API path in the URL            | Enter only the base Loki URL. Don't append API paths such as `/loki/api/v1/push`, which sends logs to Loki rather than querying it.                                                                                                   |",
      "headingPath": [
