      "id": "grafana.candidate.b589a677b480283555f9",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Localhost URL on Grafana Cloud | On Grafana Cloud, a `localhost` or private address points to Grafana servers, not your network. Use [PDC](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/) to reach a self-hosted Loki. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Loki data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "Save & test fails"
      ],
      "source": {
