    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a5cc9e37af5e8796a306",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The derived field only builds a link to the target data source using the extracted value; it doesn't create the trace. Confirm the trace is ingested into the target data source, such as Tempo, and that the extracted ID matches the trace ID stored there.",
      "headingPath": [
