      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Verify the extracted value is the correct ID. An overly permissive regular expression can capture the wrong part of the log line. Anchor the pattern and make it specific, for example match `traceID=(\\w+)` rather than a broad `(\\w+)`.",
