      "id": "grafana.candidate.68f8d4dd38832f983efd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Data sources created through provisioning are read-only in the UI, so you can't change their derived fields from the data source configuration page.",
      "headingPath": [
