      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Confirm your reverse proxy forwards WebSocket connections for the tail endpoint. Refer to the proxy examples in the [Loki query editor](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/loki/query-editor/#tail-live-logs).",
