      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Disable**     | Data sent between the client and server is **not encrypted**.                                    | Legacy environments where encryption isn't supported or required. Not recommended for production. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Microsoft SQL Server data source",
