      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **SQL Server Authentication**                         | Default method to connect to MSSQL. Use a SQL Server or Windows login in `DOMAIN\\User` format.                                  | **Username**: SQL Server username. **Password**: SQL Server password.                                                                                                                                                     |",
      "headingPath": [
