      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Windows Authentication** (Integrated Security)      | Uses the logged-in Windows user's credentials via single sign-on. Available only when SQL Server allows Windows Authentication. | No input required; uses the logged-in Windows user's credentials.                                                                                                                                                         |",
