      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As of Grafana v13.0, passwords and usernames that contain semicolons (`;`) or closing braces (`}`) are handled correctly. If you previously encountered connection failures due to special characters in credentials, upgrade to Grafana v13.0 or later.",
