    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.354f31cd4068960204c4",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Max idle**      | The maximum number of idle connections in the pool. If `max open` is set and is lower than `max idle`, then `max idle` is reduced to match. If set to `0`, no idle connections are retained. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Microsoft SQL Server data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mssql/configure/index.md",
