    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5cf8dbf88ec739684e8f",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Min time interval**  | Specifies the lower bound for the auto-generated `GROUP BY` time interval. Grafana recommends matching this value to the data write frequency. For example, use `1m` if data is written every minute. Refer to [Min time interval](#min-time-interval) for details. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Microsoft SQL Server data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mssql/configure/index.md",
