    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1e33ff7669a366224418",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Connection timeout** | Specifies the maximum number of seconds to wait when attempting to connect to the database before timing out. A value of `0` (the default) disables the timeout.                                                                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Microsoft SQL Server data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI"
