      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you previously connected using a self-managed Grafana instance and are migrating to Grafana Cloud, you must configure PDC before your private SQL Server is accessible. Direct network access methods that worked with self-managed Grafana (VPN peering, private endpoints) don't apply to Grafana Cloud.",
