    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.950bb0babfd4f5ea0487",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set the `user_identity_enabled` flag in the `[azure]` section of the [Grafana server configuration](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#azure).",
      "headingPath": [
