    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.34a673d46225efb3150a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set both `azure_auth_enabled` and `managed_identity_enabled` in the `[azure]` section of the [Grafana server configuration](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#azure):",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Microsoft SQL Server data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI",
        "Azure Entra ID (formerly Azure AD) Authentication",
        "Managed Identity"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mssql/configure/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "468ac6d022bd91271e046308509eabab23316d3c",
