      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f33027b0870aa0a7151",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Optionally, set `managed_identity_client_id` in the `[azure]` section to use a user-assigned managed identity instead of the default system-assigned identity.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Microsoft SQL Server data source",
