    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4cbeb0df9aea4b9dce5c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Format** - Select a format response from the drop-down for the MSSQL query. The default is **Table**. Refer to [Table queries](#table-queries) and [Time series queries](#time-series-queries) for more information and examples. If you select the **Time series** format option, you must include a `time` column.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Microsoft SQL Server query editor",
        "Builder mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mssql/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bbb58af24aced7414605130f50521c1a8bc6ca8c",
