      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__unixEpochFilter(dateColumn)`                       | Adds a time range filter using Unix timestamps. Example: `dateColumn > 1494410783 AND dateColumn < 1494497183`                                                                                                                             |",
