      "id": "grafana.candidate.842d5b0386920c6425de",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Grafana builds using BoringCrypto (FIPS-compliant builds) enforce FIPS 140-3 cipher requirements. SQL Server instances that only support older cipher suites (TLS 1.0, RC4, or 3DES) are incompatible with these builds.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Microsoft SQL Server data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "TLS handshake failures with FIPS-enabled Grafana"
      ],
