      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The SPN registered for the SQL Server instance doesn't match the Availability Group Listener's DNS name. Kerberos authentication requires an SPN that matches the hostname the client connects to.",
