    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4bf2a9646e55df877f0a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The data source is configured with `ApplicationIntent=ReadOnly` in the **Host** field, which routes all queries to a read-only secondary replica. If the replica is undersized, under-indexed, or experiencing replication lag, queries run much slower than on the primary.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Microsoft SQL Server data source issues",
        "Performance issues",
        "Slow dashboard load with read-only replicas"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mssql/troubleshooting/index.md",
