    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5b645bd17542409fdfcd",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Session Timezone** - Specifies the timezone used in the database session, such as `Europe/Berlin` or `+02:00`. Required if the timezone of the database (or the host of the database) is set to something other than UTC. Set this to `+00:00` so Grafana can handle times properly. Set the value used in the session with `SET time_zone='...'`. If you leave this field empty, the timezone isn't updated. For more information, refer to [MySQL Server Time Zone Support](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/en/time-zone-support.html).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the MySQL data source",
        "Additional settings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/configure/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "05ef486e6794319c0f3c26b84128b2cdfc484aa9",
        "sha256": "7693389d5c96f14adc81f27cfb16b0ff37ea9b5ad7410caaf4dae1ef41242d89",
