      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your table or database name contains a reserved word or a [prohibited character](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/en/identifiers.html) the editor puts quotes around the name. For example, the name `table-name` is quoted with backticks - `` `table-name` ``.",
