      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__timeEpoch(dateColumn)`                            | Replaces the value with an expression to convert to a UNIX Epoch timestamp and renames the column to `time_sec`. Example: _UNIX_TIMESTAMP(dateColumn) AS time_sec_.                                                                            |",
