      "sourceText": "| `$__timeFilter(dateColumn)`                           | Applies a time range filter using the specified column name and fetches only the data that falls within that range. Example: _dateColumn BETWEEN FROM_UNIXTIME(1494410783) AND FROM_UNIXTIME(1494410983)_                                      |",
