      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__timeGroup(dateColumn,'5m')`                       | Replaces the value with an expression suitable for use in a GROUP BY clause and creates the bucket timestamps at a fixed interval. Example: *cast(cast(UNIX_TIMESTAMP(dateColumn)/(300) as signed)*300 as signed),\\*                           |",
      "headingPath": [
