      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__timeGroup(dateColumn,'5m', 0)`                    | Same as the `$__timeGroup(dateColumn,'5m')` macro, but includes a fill parameter to ensure missing points in the series are added by Grafana, using 0 as the default value. **This applies only to time series queries.**                      |",
      "headingPath": [
