      "sourceText": "| `$__timeGroup(dateColumn,'5m', previous)`             | Same as the `$__timeGroup(dateColumn,'5m', previous)` macro, but uses the previous value in the series as the fill value. If no previous value exists,`NULL` will be used. **This applies only to time series queries.**                       |",
