    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c410bb2f7c8d68776df2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set the **Format** option to **Time series** to create and run time series queries.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L120-L120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4651d651fdc9aa3db45f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To run a time series query you must include a column named `time` that returns either a SQL datetime value or a numeric datatype representing the UNIX epoch time in seconds. Additionally, the query results must be sorted by the `time` column for proper visualization in panels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5200160914d6ca0c8ee6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For backward compatibility, an exception to the aforementioned rule applies to queries returning three columns, including a string column named `metric`. Instead of converting the metric column into field labels, it is used as the field name, and the series name is set to the value of the metric column. Refer to the following example with a metric column.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 141,
        "lineEnd": 141,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L141-L141"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f827817cfdd5b103ff1b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the following example, the result includes two columns, `Time` and `value_double`, which represent the data associated with fixed timestamps. This query does not apply a time range filter and returns all rows from the table.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 158,
        "lineEnd": 158,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L158-L158"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.41849e763fbeaad880df",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This example returns the same result as the previous one, but adds support for filtering data using the Grafana time picker.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 175,
        "lineEnd": 175,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L175-L175"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.267e9b6e8d0316d61f42",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Given the result in the following example, the data is grouped and aggregated within buckets with timestamps of fixed interval i.e. 5 mins. To customize the default series name formatting (optional), refer to [Standard options definitions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 193,
        "lineEnd": 193,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L193-L193"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.16c0702b49e053cd751f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following result is similar to the result of the `$__timeGroup(dateColumn,'5m')` macro, except it uses a built-in alias for the time column. To customize the default series name formatting (optional), refer to [Standard options definitions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL query editor",
        "Time series queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "337ba0971e35a147687cf26c4fbdfca2d0957e12",
        "sha256": "72419911caa4b30f1d8ca7cd56d58b2003ddcafbcc4e7f730eecabb535398ee3",
        "lineStart": 212,
        "lineEnd": 213,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/query-editor/_index.md#L212-L213"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
