      "id": "grafana.candidate.e70f33993078f93fd6c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A query can return multiple columns, and Grafana automatically generates a list using the values from those columns. For example, the following query returns values from both the `hostname` and `hostname2` columns, which are included in the variable's drop-down list.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 40,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L40-L40"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23408d7c54198be7d2f8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use time range dependent macros like `$__timeFilter(column)` in your query, you must set the template variable's refresh mode to **On Time Range Change**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.352ef50a938e4bc8c7a2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can create a key/value variable so the drop-down shows a user-friendly label (for example, hostname) while panel queries use a different value (for example, ID). Use the variable editor's **Value field** and **Text field** at the bottom of the query section to specify which query columns supply the value and the label. Your query can use any column names; you don't need `__value` or `__text` in the SQL.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Key/value variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b3f32c3e326063dd9878",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Example: run a query that returns `hostname` and `id`, then set **Text field** to `hostname` and **Value field** to `id`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Key/value variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 56,
        "lineEnd": 56,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L56-L56"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad32ec7a799511a37b7b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Note that the values in the text column should be unique. If there are duplicates, Grafana uses only the first matching entry.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Key/value variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L62-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3e198da54ea9c9bd1dcf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alternatively, you can use the legacy approach: return columns named `__text` and `__value` in your query (for example, `SELECT hostname AS __text, id AS __value FROM my_host`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Key/value variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bfd95c853946afbbb3c4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can create nested variables, where one variable depends on the value of another. For example, if you have a variable named `region`, you can configure a `hosts` variable to only show hosts from the selected region. If `region` is a multi-value variable, use the `IN` operator instead of `=` to match against multiple selected values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Nested variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 68,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L68-L68"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a2544047970a7cea44f9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using `__searchFilter` in the query field allows the query results to be filtered based on the user's input in the drop-down selection box. If you don't enter anything, the default value for `__searchFilter` is `%`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Filter results with `__searchFilter`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 76,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L76-L76"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c964c9148d6b6598cbc6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Note that you must enclose the `__searchFilter` expression in quotes as Grafana doesn't add them automatically.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Filter results with `__searchFilter`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 78,
        "lineEnd": 78,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L78-L78"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53c17f67e42ea75cc64d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example demonstrates how to use `__searchFilter` in the query field to enable real-time searching for `hostname` as the user types in the drop-down selection box.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Query variable",
        "Filter results with `__searchFilter`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.49fc4a379cf75e8944ff",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana automatically quotes template variable values only when the template variable is a `multi-value`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 88,
        "lineEnd": 88,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L88-L88"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.72ea93952641d8be6562",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When using a multi-value variable, use the `IN` comparison operator instead of `=` to match against multiple values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 90,
        "lineEnd": 90,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L90-L90"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8e7cc6ebf6ce5d14aa6f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports two syntaxes for using variables in queries:",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aaa17ef05de487ebfff0",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **`$<varname>` syntax**",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 94,
        "lineEnd": 94,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L94-L94"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5dab4d02f5b73d5c3f6d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **`[[varname]]` syntax**",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bce902c4c62c6aca3e89",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana formats multi-value variables as a quoted, comma-separated string. For example, if `server01` and `server02` are selected, the result will be `'server01'`, `'server02'`. To disable quoting, use the `csv` formatting option for variables:",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries",
        "Disable quoting for multi-value variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0018942262615a919bf5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Don't rely on implicit quoting behavior for string variables in SQL queries. Quoting behavior can vary depending on panel type and context:",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries",
        "Use explicit quoting for string variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8b4e9af927fd60ebb0f752a26f1b5318eb25a81f",
        "sha256": "782e0b5075e4a5b068515118097fb27d9b7924eba557b77b504f55d9b64978c9",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 134,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md#L134-L134"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1251feceebdb80494307",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Repeat panels** may not quote single-value variables at all, causing bare values to appear in the SQL and breaking the query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "MySQL template variables",
        "Use variables in queries",
        "Use explicit quoting for string variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/template-variables/index.md",
