      "id": "grafana.candidate.bee2b55165894c205396",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The Grafana MySQL driver doesn't handle all MySQL string subtypes (such as `ENUM`, `SET`, `TINYTEXT`, or `MEDIUMTEXT`) in `CASE` expressions. The driver may fail to infer the result type correctly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot MySQL data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "`CASE` expression fails on non-standard string column types"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/troubleshooting/index.md",
