    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.87c31e61aa30f33df773",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** When a MySQL data source is provisioned via YAML, the query caching toggle in the UI is greyed out. YAML provisioning doesn't currently support setting caching configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot MySQL data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Query caching can't be enabled on a provisioned data source"
      ],
      "source": {
