    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6680767aec20e42f391a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Use the Grafana HTTP API to enable query caching on the provisioned data source. Send a `PUT` request to update the data source with caching enabled:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot MySQL data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Query caching can't be enabled on a provisioned data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/mysql/troubleshooting/index.md",
