    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a43f63b71bd8aa16602d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana ships with OpenTSDB preinstalled in both Grafana OSS and Enterprise, so there's nothing for you to install. The data source is now packaged as a standalone plugin that updates independently of Grafana releases. For details, refer to [Plugin updates](#plugin-updates).",
