      "id": "grafana.candidate.ddc3d4c2e46aff35615b",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **==2.2** | Adds filter support (`literal_or`, `wildcard`, `regexp`, and more). Filters replace tags for more flexible queries.          |",
