    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0aedafce12ece5dfcc22",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When **Explicit tags** is enabled (version 2.3+), OpenTSDB only returns time series that have all the tags specified in your query. This prevents unexpected results when some time series are missing tags that others have.",
      "headingPath": [
        "OpenTSDB query editor",
        "Rate section",
        "Explicit tags"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/opentsdb/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "01bc2b6185358f9399d1f6faffaa6bcc906a584c",
        "sha256": "8beb79129e8e2e09450823f40e464471b5de67631fb27b36fd9fdafe4ba50d00",
        "lineStart": 192,
        "lineEnd": 192,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/opentsdb/query-editor/index.md#L192-L192"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f6163ff62e0e404d924a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The aggregator function combines multiple time series into one. The data source includes a built-in default list (`avg`, `sum`, `min`, `max`, `dev`, `zimsum`, `mimmin`, and `mimmax`), then replaces it with the list fetched from your OpenTSDB server. As a result, you may see additional aggregators, such as `count`, beyond the built-in defaults.",
      "headingPath": [
        "OpenTSDB query editor",
        "Aggregators"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/opentsdb/query-editor/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "01bc2b6185358f9399d1f6faffaa6bcc906a584c",
        "sha256": "8beb79129e8e2e09450823f40e464471b5de67631fb27b36fd9fdafe4ba50d00",
        "lineStart": 196,
        "lineEnd": 196,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/opentsdb/query-editor/index.md#L196-L196"
