      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `tag_names` and `tag_values` functions use the OpenTSDB lookup API, which requires metrics to exist in your database. The `suggest_tagk` and `suggest_tagv` functions use the suggest API, which searches across all metrics.",
