      "sourceText": "Parca is a continuous profiling database for analysis of CPU and memory usage, down to the line number and throughout time. Grafana ships with built-in support for Parca, so you can add it as a data source and start querying your profiles in [Explore](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/).",
