    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ebd09a24b40890553ba7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Parca returns profiles aggregated over the selected time range. The absolute values in the flame graph grow as the time range gets bigger while keeping the relative values meaningful. You can zoom in on the time range to get a higher granularity profile, down to the point of a single Parca scrape interval.",
