    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a39f6f1a55502a29758d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead of hard-coding label values in your profiling queries, you can use template variables to create dynamic, reusable dashboards. Variables appear as drop-down menus at the top of the dashboard, making it easy to switch between services, instances, or environments without editing queries.",
