      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Parca query editor's label selector field supports template variable interpolation. Use the standard `$variablename` or `${variablename}` syntax. Variables are interpolated in the label selector only -- the profile type drop-down doesn't support them.",
