      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The PostgreSQL data source supports [Grafana Alerting](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/). You can create alert rules that evaluate time series queries against your PostgreSQL database and send notifications when conditions are met.",
