      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a6ac5c29c7802836528d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Test in Explore first:** Verify your query returns the expected time series in [Explore](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/) before using it in an alert rule. Check the **Format** is set to **Time series** and results are sorted by time.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL alerting",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/alerting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "901b418010d37d6488c9b8189d172db15cfd8caa",
