      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This document explains how to configure the PostgreSQL data source and lists all configuration options. For general information on managing data sources, refer to [Data source management](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/data-source-management/).",
