      "id": "grafana.candidate.b15dd167ab2d194ef028",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Grafana ships with the PostgreSQL data source preinstalled in OSS and Enterprise. You don't need to install a plugin. For update options, refer to [Plugin updates](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/postgres/#plugin-updates).",
