      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When adding a data source, the database user you specify should have only `SELECT` permissions on the relevant schemas and tables. Grafana does not validate the safety of queries, so users could run potentially harmful SQL (for example, `DROP TABLE`). Create a dedicated PostgreSQL user with restricted permissions to limit risk.",
