    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.042e4a09fddfd6ea7ea9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Grafana Cloud users:** Grafana Cloud can't reach databases on `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, or private IP ranges (`10.x`, `172.16.x`, `192.168.x`) directly. If your PostgreSQL instance isn't publicly accessible, you must set up [Private data source connect (PDC)](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/) to establish a secure tunnel between Grafana Cloud and your private network. If you experience intermittent connection drops with the Docker-based PDC agent, try switching to the binary-based agent instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the PostgreSQL data source",
        "PostgreSQL configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/configure/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3fa58c948b0bf3b26944c892731ea7f7ab5003c1",
        "sha256": "90a16bbd606fb20084f376196f69a52ecbb0a7663384296e64a21d3b1f9a0a3b",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/configure/_index.md#L70-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7cda9fb73cef269deffa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your database is publicly accessible but protected by a firewall, you must allowlist the Grafana Cloud outbound IP addresses. Grafana Cloud doesn't provide per-stack static IP addresses. It provides only service-level IP ranges. For the current list of outbound IP addresses, refer to [Allow Grafana Cloud IP addresses in a firewall](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/allow-grafana-cloud-ips/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the PostgreSQL data source",
        "PostgreSQL configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/configure/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3fa58c948b0bf3b26944c892731ea7f7ab5003c1",
        "sha256": "90a16bbd606fb20084f376196f69a52ecbb0a7663384296e64a21d3b1f9a0a3b",
        "lineStart": 72,
