    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.51d343dfd0a5c47ee88d",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| TLS/SSL Mode          | Determines whether and how a secure TLS/SSL connection is negotiated with the server. Refer to the [TLS/SSL mode reference](#tlsssl-mode-reference) for guidance on each mode. When set to `disable`, the TLS/SSL Method and Auth Details options aren't visible.                                                                                                                                           |",
