      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| - Certificate content | This option allows you to configure certificates by specifying their content. The content is stored and encrypted in the Grafana database. When connecting to the database, the certificates are saved as files, on the local filesystem, in the Grafana data path.                                                                                                                                         |",
