    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1cded3f7ac01a7ad127",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| TimescaleDB       | A time-series database built as a PostgreSQL extension. When enabled, Grafana uses `time_bucket` in the `$__timeGroup` macro and displays TimescaleDB-specific aggregate functions in the query builder. Grafana auto-detects TimescaleDB on save if your server is version 9.6 or later and the extension is installed. For more information, refer to [TimescaleDB documentation](https://docs.timescale.com/timescaledb/latest/tutorials/grafana/grafana-timescalecloud/#connect-timescaledb-and-grafana). |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the PostgreSQL data source",
        "PostgreSQL configuration options",
        "TLS/SSL mode reference"
      ],
