      "id": "grafana.candidate.1f2c9bee0025fa3b4673",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Auto max idle | Toggle to set the maximum number of idle connections to the number of maximum open connections. This setting is toggled on by default.                                                                               |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the PostgreSQL data source",
