    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.372cbc250d062256c2bf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your Grafana instance has the Secure SOCKS proxy feature enabled, a toggle appears in the data source settings. When enabled, Grafana routes PostgreSQL connections through a SOCKS proxy for secure access to databases in private networks. For more information, refer to [Configure a Secure SOCKS5 proxy](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the PostgreSQL data source",
        "PostgreSQL configuration options",
        "TLS/SSL mode reference"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/configure/_index.md",
