      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can define and configure the data source in YAML files with [provisioning](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/provisioning/#data-sources). For more information about provisioning and available configuration options, refer to [Provision Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/provisioning/#datasources).",
