      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you encounter metric request errors or other issues when provisioning, refer to [Provisioning errors](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/postgres/troubleshooting/#provisioning-errors) in the PostgreSQL troubleshooting guide.",
