    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.21ea21bc3af4d41b9138",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The PostgreSQL query editor lets you build and run queries against your data source. For general query editor and data transformation concepts, refer to [Query and transform data](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f8240fd741664f30181d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can open the PostgreSQL query editor from the [Explore page](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/) or from a dashboard panel. Click the ellipsis in the upper right of the panel and select **Edit**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2a5bf33aa49956eb1aa4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A default database must be configured in the data source settings. If none is set, or it is removed, the data source doesn't run queries until a database is configured again.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0303db812c3f31166933",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The PostgreSQL query editor has two modes: **Builder** and **Code**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "PostgreSQL query editor components"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0f5cb316dd3f7ad26ac3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Builder mode helps you build a query using a visual interface. Code mode allows for advanced querying and offers support for complex SQL query writing.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "PostgreSQL query editor components"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
