    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.520958c150edc916393c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Format** - Select the query result format from the drop-down. The default is **Table**. If you use the **Time series** format option, one of the columns must be `time`. Refer to [Time series queries](#time-series-queries) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "PostgreSQL query editor components",
        "PostgreSQL Builder mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
