      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__timeGroupAlias(dateColumn,'5m')`      | Same as `$__timeGroup` but with an added column alias `AS \"time\"`. With TimescaleDB, uses `time_bucket()`.                                                                                                    |",
