      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__unixEpochFilter(dateColumn)`                      | Replaces the value with a time range filter for columns storing UNIX epoch (seconds). Example: `dateColumn >= 1494410783 AND dateColumn <= 1494497183`.                        |",
