      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `$__unixEpochGroup(dateColumn,'5m', [fillmode])`      | Same as `$__timeGroup` but for columns storing UNIX epoch (seconds). Example: `floor((dateColumn)/300)*300`. `fillMode` only applies to time series queries.                   |",
      "headingPath": [
