    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0cd14deb00b07783c5c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Keep the following behavior in mind when using macros:",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "Macros",
        "Macro behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 115,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L115-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9edf9340ce49ac369544",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Comment stripping:** Grafana strips SQL comments (`--` line comments and `/* */` block comments) before expanding macros. Macros placed inside comments aren't expanded.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "Macros",
        "Macro behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 117,
        "lineEnd": 117,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L117-L117"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0f8cbcbf269d65b07246",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **TimescaleDB mode:** When the **TimescaleDB** toggle is enabled in the data source configuration, `$__timeGroup` and `$__timeGroupAlias` use the PostgreSQL `time_bucket()` function instead of `floor(extract(epoch ...))`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "Macros",
        "Macro behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 118,
        "lineEnd": 118,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L118-L118"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.258685b75916fb43d49d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Trailing comma pattern:** A `$__timeGroup(...)` call followed immediately by a comma (`,`) is automatically treated as `$__timeGroupAlias(...)`, adding the `AS \"time\"` alias. This is a legacy convenience. Use `$__timeGroupAlias` explicitly for clarity.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "Macros",
        "Macro behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 119,
        "lineEnd": 119,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L119-L119"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7e50f9c3658c1b068279",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Inspect expanded SQL:** To view the final SQL after macro expansion, open the [Query inspector](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/#query-inspector) in a panel and check the query that was sent to the database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "Macros",
        "Macro behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
        "sha256": "039487ccd5bee34210f2a93dfc270b66e758127ff361f491daa43c2203030f7f",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md#L120-L120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3e9ac35023024f7feee8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the **Format** option is set to **Table**, you can execute virtually any type of SQL query. The Table panel automatically displays the resulting columns and rows from your query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "PostgreSQL query editor",
        "Table queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/postgres/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "da418c753c9813f78e1d4eed64e0946e46a50b3e",
