      "id": "grafana.candidate.a28efd6eb9319455662c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Grafana Cloud runs in a hosted environment and can't directly reach databases on `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, or private IP ranges (`10.x`, `172.16.x`, `192.168.x`). This is the most common issue when migrating from self-managed Grafana to Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot PostgreSQL data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "Grafana Cloud can't reach a private database"
      ],
