    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6c33d4277169b9eaff11",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Grafana-managed recording rules](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules/) pre-compute expensive PromQL expressions on a schedule and write the results back to a Prometheus-compatible data source as a new metric. This lets you query the pre-aggregated metric instead of re-evaluating the expensive expression on every dashboard load or alert evaluation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus alerting",
        "Recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/alerting/index.md",
