      "id": "grafana.candidate.361c98995ec44e95f966",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Use `$__rate_interval`:** When using `rate()` or `increase()` in alert queries, use `$__rate_interval` to ensure the range window is always large enough relative to the scrape interval. Grafana resolves this variable based on the evaluation interval and scrape interval configuration.",
