      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Annotations overlay event data on your dashboard graphs, helping you correlate events with metrics. You can use Prometheus as a data source for annotations to display events such as deployments, alerts, or threshold crossings on your visualizations.",
