    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.12e45a0f990c4761394b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Every data point returned creates an annotation.** There is no automatic filtering of zero values. If you only want annotations at specific moments, your PromQL expression must filter the results (for example, using `> 0` or the `ALERTS` metric).",
      "headingPath": [
