    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d94a0d31b6e1f5d0188a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Azure AD and SigV4 authentication on the core Prometheus data source are **deprecated** in Grafana 13. Existing data sources using these methods are automatically migrated to dedicated plugins on startup. For new setups, use the [Azure Monitor Managed Service for Prometheus](https://grafana.com/grafana/plugins/grafana-azureprometheus-datasource/) or [Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus](https://grafana.com/grafana/plugins/grafana-amazonprometheus-datasource/) plugins instead. For migration details, refer to [Azure authentication (deprecated)](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/prometheus/configure/azure-authentication/) or [AWS authentication (deprecated)](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/prometheus/configure/aws-authentication/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Prometheus data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/configure/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a1a3fd736210bc04f6d5396f44fbd51007b0b737",
        "sha256": "8f55c60524f648dcca948fcbb550ecdf916cf54bf2cc152f1e84db0d2c51c35b",
        "lineStart": 88,
        "lineEnd": 88,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/configure/_index.md#L88-L88"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8033a571966a86e45141",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Azure AD authentication** - Available in Grafana Enterprise and self-managed instances where `azure_auth_enabled = true` is configured. On Grafana Cloud, this option requires a server-side feature flag that isn't enabled by default. Contact [Grafana Support](https://grafana.com/profile/org#support) to request it be enabled for your stack. Refer to [Azure authentication settings](#azure-authentication-settings-deprecated) for configuration details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Prometheus data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Authentication"
      ],
