    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2b3d72088b05d18b2732",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **AWS SigV4 authentication** - Available in self-managed Grafana instances where `sigv4_auth_enabled = true` is configured. On Grafana Cloud, this option isn't available by default. Contact [Grafana Support](https://grafana.com/profile/org#support) to request it be enabled for your stack.",
