      "id": "grafana.candidate.670c6fd62af339c87dc9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If Azure AD or SigV4 options don't appear in the authentication drop-down, the required feature flag isn't enabled on your instance. For Grafana Cloud, submit a support request. For self-managed instances, update the Grafana configuration file.",
