    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d592c73c15e45969950d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Scrape interval** - Sets the standard scrape and evaluation interval in Prometheus. The default is `15s`. Set it to match the typical scrape and evaluation interval in your Prometheus configuration file. If you set a higher value than your Prometheus configuration, Grafana evaluates data at this interval, resulting in less data points.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Prometheus data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Interval behavior"
      ],
