      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.857c487c331c3fb256cb",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Incremental querying (beta)** - Toggle on to enable incremental querying. Instead of always requesting fresh data from the Prometheus instance, Grafana caches query results and only fetches new records. This helps reduce database and network load.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Prometheus data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Performance"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/configure/_index.md",
