    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eb02042ead61b21d8db5",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Disable recording rules (beta)** - Toggle on to disable recording rules. When disabled, Grafana won't fetch and parse recording rules from Prometheus, improving dashboard performance by reducing processing overhead.",
