    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a87a423a6859c6d79174",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Custom query parameters** - Add custom parameters to the Prometheus query URL for more control over query execution. Examples: `timeout`, `partial_response`, `dedup`, or `max_source_resolution`. Join multiple parameters with `&`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Prometheus data source",
