    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d54c21360e19f7d131d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **HTTP method** - Select either the `POST` or `GET` HTTP method to query your data source. `POST` is recommended and selected by default, as it supports larger queries. Select `GET` if your network restricts `POST` requests.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Prometheus data source",
        "Configuration options",
        "Other"
