    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ecaf732cefc661413650",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Use series endpoint** - Toggle on to use the series endpoint (`/api/v1/series`) with the `match[]` parameter instead of the label values endpoint (`/api/v1/label/<label_name>/values`). The label values endpoint is generally more performant, but the series endpoint supports the `POST` method.",
