      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Support for exemplars is available only for the Prometheus data source. An exemplar is a trace that represents a specific measurement taken within a given time interval. For more information, refer to [Introduction to exemplars](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/fundamentals/exemplars/).",
