      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "PDC supports both querying and writing to Prometheus-compatible data sources. This means [Grafana-managed recording rules](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules/) can write their results to a Prometheus or Mimir instance behind a PDC connection.",
