      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Sets the minimum interval between data points returned by the query. For example, setting this to `1h` means data is returned at hourly intervals at minimum. This setting supports the `$__interval` and `$__rate_interval` macros.",
