    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.14d2945a2220438dc610",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Range:** Returns a set of time series where each series includes multiple data points over the selected time range. Use this for graph visualizations (lines, bars, points, stacked).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query options",
        "Type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 68,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L68-L68"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9bc5317ee65af2c65c95",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Instant:** Returns a single data point per series (the most recent value within the selected time range). Use this for stat panels, tables, or gauges. To visualize instant query results in a time series panel, add a field override with the `Transform` property set to `Constant`. For more information, refer to [Time Series Transform option](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/visualizations/time-series/#transform).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query options",
        "Type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c9003bf99fee82e7a9f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The query type doesn't change how aggregations are calculated. Both types evaluate the same PromQL expression, including aggregation operators such as `sum`, `avg`, and `count`. The type only controls how many points in time Grafana evaluates:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query options",
        "Type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2d3ba2036af28bf7f57f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- An **Instant** query evaluates the expression once, at the end of the selected time range, and returns a single value per series.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query options",
        "Type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd2c27e9e8bb7c76c4c7",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A **Range** query evaluates the same expression at every step across the range, and returns a value per series at each step.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query options",
        "Type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 74,
        "lineEnd": 74,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L74-L74"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.184b51dbd2fafdb71088",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because both types run the same aggregation at each evaluated timestamp, an Instant query returns the same value as the most recent data point of the equivalent Range query. For example, `sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))` returns one value as an Instant query and the full history of that value as a Range query, where the final Range data point matches the Instant result.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query options",
        "Type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
