    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.df270d35f6a484c72e17",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **No data returned:** Check the Query tab to see if template variables resolved to empty values. Try the query directly in the Prometheus built-in expression browser (`/graph`) to rule out Grafana-specific issues.",
