    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8862115626173703c1b4",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Fewer series than expected:** Check that your label filters aren't too restrictive. Remove filters one at a time to isolate which filter is excluding data.",
      "headingPath": [
