    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbdd5e07da7651938571",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **\"Too many data points\" or timeout:** Reduce the time range, increase the Min step, or add aggregations to reduce cardinality. Refer to [Query high-cardinality data](#query-high-cardinality-data).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Use the query inspector"
      ],
      "source": {
