    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0845dd5b5b4c256d7c02",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "High-cardinality metrics (those with many unique label combinations) can cause queries to timeout or exceed memory limits when queried over long time ranges. Follow these practices to query high-cardinality data effectively:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query high-cardinality data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 301,
        "lineEnd": 301,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L301-L301"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4076ded0360aae3dcd97",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Aggregate first, then filter:** Use `sum()`, `avg()`, or `count()` to reduce the number of series before applying other operations. For example, `sum(rate(metric[5m])) by (service)` is far cheaper than querying all individual Pod-level series.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query high-cardinality data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cdc563c3108dcd9de35912dff1febc0228715bda",
        "sha256": "dc2247aa971e1b7926cb68555c77d8874fd592b3a2d6c533b9124b98204dc690",
        "lineStart": 303,
        "lineEnd": 303,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md#L303-L303"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d684348c69f8ccbf9877",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Use recording rules for repeated queries:** If a dashboard panel queries the same expensive expression on every load, create a [Prometheus recording rule](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/recording_rules/) to pre-compute the result.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
        "Query high-cardinality data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/_index.md",
