    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.32dc6a9b45fe8ae9c04b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Scope with template variables:** Use dashboard [template variables](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/) to select a specific `namespace`, `cluster`, or `job` rather than querying all labels at once.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus query editor",
