    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.73208db4e1d502c9d332",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Use Adaptive Metrics (Grafana Cloud):** [Adaptive Metrics](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/cost-management-and-billing/reduce-costs/metrics-costs/control-metrics-usage-via-adaptive-metrics/) automatically reduces the cardinality of metrics that aren't queried at full resolution.",
