      "id": "grafana.candidate.c49179860e5baa958868",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Metrics**       | `metric` (optional)                     | Returns metric names matching the specified regular expression.                 | Metric: `node_.*` → returns `node_cpu_seconds_total`, `node_memory_MemFree_bytes`, etc. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus template variables",
