    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fd075d1f1b44e1a4ca6b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Missing or incorrect scrape interval setting:** If the data source scrape interval is left at the default `15s` but your actual Prometheus scrape interval is `60s`, `$__rate_interval` calculates too small a window. This causes `rate()` to return no data because there aren't enough data points in the window.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus template variables",
        "Use `$__rate_interval`",
        "Common pitfalls"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c46792368b7251ac53d6d7b96120137523c04b66",
        "sha256": "cf10aa9014dc6c9b0b74b8ca53b59bdde3afa0237815afbd531f7cd5501471dd",
        "lineStart": 174,
        "lineEnd": 174,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md#L174-L174"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6e06fc57556008d59231",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Different values in edit mode versus dashboard:** When editing a query, the panel displays at full width. On the dashboard, the panel may be narrower, which increases `$__interval` and therefore `$__rate_interval`. Queries that work in edit mode may produce different results (or gaps) on the dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus template variables",
        "Use `$__rate_interval`",
        "Common pitfalls"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c46792368b7251ac53d6d7b96120137523c04b66",
        "sha256": "cf10aa9014dc6c9b0b74b8ca53b59bdde3afa0237815afbd531f7cd5501471dd",
        "lineStart": 176,
        "lineEnd": 176,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md#L176-L176"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e6f71e953bb6cbf05a53",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **LBAC-enabled data sources:** Data sources using Label-Based Access Control (LBAC) may not inherit the scrape interval setting from the parent data source. Set the **Min step** explicitly on each query panel to ensure a correct `$__rate_interval` calculation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus template variables",
        "Use `$__rate_interval`",
        "Common pitfalls"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c46792368b7251ac53d6d7b96120137523c04b66",
        "sha256": "cf10aa9014dc6c9b0b74b8ca53b59bdde3afa0237815afbd531f7cd5501471dd",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7a5cdf6bb47636814d7e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Recording rules with fixed intervals:** If you use `$__rate_interval` in a recording rule query, the interval depends on the evaluation context. For recording rules, use a fixed interval (for example, `[5m]`) rather than `$__rate_interval`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus template variables",
        "Use `$__rate_interval`",
        "Common pitfalls"
      ],
      "source": {
