    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7443ce0165db8239c3f6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If **Multi-value** or **Include All** is enabled, the variable value becomes a regular expression pattern (for example, `value1|value2`). Use `=~` instead of `=` in your label matchers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Prometheus template variables",
        "Variable syntax"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/template-variables/_index.md",
