    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.69d59793a120838b404b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Symptom:** Prometheus queries fail intermittently or consistently when using Private data source connect (PDC) to reach a Prometheus instance behind a private network. The data source test may pass occasionally but queries fail under load.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 90,
        "lineEnd": 90,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L90-L90"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.666848a53f08a207b18f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** PDC tunnels traffic through an SSH connection between Grafana Cloud and your PDC agent. Connectivity failures are most commonly caused by DNS resolution issues, network configuration on the customer side, or the PDC agent's default connection limits being too low for the query volume.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0ab06e220e5741cdeb20",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Verify DNS resolution from the PDC agent host.** The PDC agent must be able to resolve the Prometheus hostname from the machine it runs on. Run `nslookup` or `dig` for the Prometheus URL from the agent host to confirm.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 96,
        "lineEnd": 96,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L96-L96"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5936d170bf1cd14d590e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Check network connectivity from the agent.** Ensure the PDC agent can reach the Prometheus endpoint directly (for example, `curl http://prometheus-host:9090/-/healthy` from the agent machine).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1f95d30c8a9b6b176b82",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Increase parallel SSH connections.** The PDC agent defaults to 1 parallel SSH connection, which can bottleneck under load from multiple alert evaluations or dashboard queries. Increase this by setting the `--ssh-connections` flag (or `PDC_SSH_CONNECTIONS` environment variable) to a higher value (for example, 4 or 8):",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L98-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aec8a2b72ff7b5db0028",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Check firewall rules.** Ensure the PDC agent's outbound SSH connection to Grafana Cloud isn't being interrupted by firewall rules, NAT gateways, or idle connection timeouts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L104-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e34728f69747f8c30d1",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Verify the PDC agent is running and healthy.** Check agent logs for connection errors or restarts. The agent must maintain a persistent connection to Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Connection errors",
        "PDC connectivity errors"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
