    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.660845e6a6060e6a6146",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Use the **GCP datasource-syncer** pattern: run a sidecar process that refreshes OAuth tokens and updates the Grafana data source credentials on a schedule shorter than the token lifetime (typically every 45 minutes for a 60-minute token). This ensures the stored token is always valid when the alerting backend uses it.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "OAuth token expiration errors (GCP and Azure)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
