    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.118c1f6f75bc1f33fc2a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If the issue persists, set **Alert state if execution error or timeout** to **Keep Last State** to prevent false alarms while investigating. Refer to [Configure alert state for execution errors](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/prometheus/alerting/#configure-alert-state-for-execution-errors).",
