    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b852e7a2cc4cdf07dae0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Symptom:** You've configured Team LBAC rules, but users can still see all metrics regardless of their team assignments.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "LBAC not restricting data on non-Mimir backends"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 191,
        "lineEnd": 191,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L191-L191"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2ed5ca0f1fe249fcdebd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Label-Based Access Control (LBAC) for the Prometheus data source only works when the backend is **Grafana Cloud Metrics (Mimir)** or **Grafana Enterprise Metrics (GEM)**. It doesn't work with Google Managed Prometheus, self-managed Prometheus, Thanos, or other Prometheus-compatible endpoints. The LBAC enforcement relies on Mimir-specific HTTP headers (`X-Scope-OrgID` and team-scoped label matchers) that other backends ignore.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "LBAC not restricting data on non-Mimir backends"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 193,
        "lineEnd": 193,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L193-L193"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.287151b6de46f31408d8",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify your backend is Grafana Cloud Metrics or GEM. If you're using a different Prometheus-compatible backend, LBAC isn't supported.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "LBAC not restricting data on non-Mimir backends"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
