      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8988a8a1a5fbf7aa722d",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For Google Managed Prometheus or other external endpoints, use [data source permissions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/data-source-management/#data-source-permissions) to control which teams can access the data source entirely, rather than per-label access control.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "LBAC not restricting data on non-Mimir backends"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
