      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1b3c2d3ff6c930889284",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If you need per-label restrictions on a non-Mimir backend, consider proxying through a Mimir instance or using a separate data source per team with different credentials scoped to the appropriate data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "LBAC not restricting data on non-Mimir backends"
      ],
