    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ec8ad6f0d3acd2c7f385",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Prometheus and Mimir enforce per-query memory and sample limits to protect the system from resource exhaustion. High-cardinality metrics (for example, metrics with a `pod`, `request_id`, or `user_id` label) multiplied by long time ranges produce result sets that exceed these limits.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "Memory limit exceeded for high-cardinality queries"
      ],
      "source": {
