      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Create [recording rules](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/recording_rules/) that pre-compute the aggregation you need. For example, if you commonly query `sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])) by (service)`, create a recording rule for it and query the pre-aggregated metric instead.",
