      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Symptom:** `increase()` returns fractional values on integer counters, `rate()` shows an ever-increasing value instead of a steady per-second rate, or counter resets cause large spikes in visualizations.",
