      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `increase()` fractional values                | Expected behavior. Prometheus uses linear interpolation. Use `ceil()` or `floor()` if you need integers.                                              |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
