      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For more information, refer to [$\\_\\_rate_interval for Prometheus rate queries that just work](https://grafana.com/blog/2020/09/28/new-in-grafana-7.2-__rate_interval-for-prometheus-rate-queries-that-just-work/).",
