    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9727c1cdd352ea92cb9c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Symptom:** Queries using `$__rate_interval` return no data, return different values in edit mode versus the dashboard, or produce unexpected gaps.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Configuration errors",
        "`$__rate_interval` returns no data or incorrect values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 408,
        "lineEnd": 408,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L408-L408"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea67e6190acd5ac3bf2e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** `$__rate_interval` is calculated as `max($__interval + scrape_interval, 4 * scrape_interval)`. If any input to this formula is incorrect, the resulting window is wrong: either too small (no data) or inconsistent across contexts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Configuration errors",
        "`$__rate_interval` returns no data or incorrect values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 410,
        "lineEnd": 410,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L410-L410"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
