    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef00988d6dd78ab8ae54",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Data source scrape interval left at default `15s` while actual Prometheus scrape interval is longer (for example, `60s`) | Set the **Scrape interval** under **Interval behavior** in the data source configuration to match your Prometheus `scrape_interval`.      |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Configuration errors",
        "`$__rate_interval` returns no data or incorrect values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
