    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0365fcd09b49919994bb",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Query works in edit mode but shows gaps on the dashboard                                                                 | Panel size affects `$__interval`. Smaller panels produce larger intervals. Set a **Min step** on the query to enforce a consistent floor. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Configuration errors",
        "`$__rate_interval` returns no data or incorrect values"
      ],
