    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.653b3e2232cdcafed9c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** By default, when an alert rule encounters an execution error or timeout, Grafana sets the alert state to **Alerting**, which fires the alert. Transient connectivity issues between Grafana and Prometheus (i/o timeouts, deadline exceeded, brief outages) trigger this behavior even though the underlying metric hasn't crossed its threshold.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Prometheus data source issues",
        "Alerting errors",
        "Transient alert errors triggering false alarms"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8e50ee5b80f0d882f5c254bfa20a82f2a9d1c982",
        "sha256": "5d62682b47e6f29d1a4603953a8584079c2b939a9feca62c15b80a8307623e18",
        "lineStart": 513,
        "lineEnd": 513,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/prometheus/troubleshooting/index.md#L513-L513"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
