      "sourceText": "Grafana Pyroscope is a horizontally scalable, highly available, multi-tenant, OSS, continuous profiling aggregation system. Add a Pyroscope data source to query your profiles in [Explore](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/).",
