      "id": "grafana.candidate.ed631d2665374be9b96c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Explain flame graph:** On views with a flame graph, Grafana Cloud provides an AI-driven analysis that explains the performance bottleneck, its root cause, and a recommended fix. For more information, refer to [Flame graph AI](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/monitor-applications/profiles/flamegraph-ai/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Pyroscope data source",
