      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Your application must be instrumented for profiles and traces. For more information, refer to [Link traces to profiles](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-client/trace-span-profiles/).",
