      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the span attribute `pyroscope.profile.id` isn't present on the span, the OpenTelemetry bridge package isn't configured correctly. Refer to [Link tracing and profiling with span profiles](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-client/trace-span-profiles/) for per-language setup instructions.",
