      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify that you installed and configured the OTel bridge package for your language. This is a separate package from the Pyroscope SDK and OpenTelemetry SDK. Refer to [Link tracing and profiling with span profiles](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-client/trace-span-profiles/) for per-language instructions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Trace to profiles",
