      "id": "grafana.candidate.a55228c97e1edc3f0101",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. CPU profiling only captures time spent actively executing on the CPU. If the span is mostly waiting on I/O, network calls, or database queries, the CPU profile for that span may be sparse or empty.",
      "headingPath": [
