      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use Transport Layer Security (TLS) for an additional layer of security when working with Pyroscope. For additional information on setting up TLS encryption with Pyroscope, refer to [Pyroscope configuration](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/).",
