    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.970ceaa370bdca85202a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Query variable definitions also support variables. You can reference one variable in another to chain **Label** and **Label value** queries, as shown in [Chain dependent variables](#query-variable-examples).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Pyroscope template variables",
        "Where you can use template variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/pyroscope/template-variables/index.md",
