    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5825b39e1c958f1a6498",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you add the variable, a filter bar appears at the top of the dashboard. Viewers can add filters by selecting a label, an operator (`=`, `!=`, `=~`, `!~`), and a value. Grafana applies these filters to all Pyroscope queries on the dashboard.",
