    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2326a5794d9349b84a04",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a query over a long time range returns data only for the most recent days, the query time range likely exceeds a server-side query limit. This is most commonly reported in Grafana Cloud Profiles. Refer to [Query time range and retention limits](#query-time-range-and-retention-limits).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Pyroscope data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "Queries return only recent data even though older data is retained"
      ],
