    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5101ad4cb0f86cb66ce3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Span profiling correlates profiling samples with the active trace span, which requires a language SDK and the OpenTelemetry span-profiling bridge. eBPF-based collection can't associate samples with individual spans, so it doesn't produce span profiles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Pyroscope data source issues",
        "Trace to profiles issues",
        "Span profiles aren't available with eBPF-based collection"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/pyroscope/troubleshooting/index.md",
