    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9ba422a7cc2415002fd9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The span-profiling bridge labels profiling samples with `span_name` and `trace_id`. Depending on the SDK, profiling context may be attached only to the root span of a trace, with child spans inheriting it. `span_id` is high cardinality and isn't a dependable correlation label.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Pyroscope data source issues",
        "Trace to profiles issues",
        "Filter span profiles by span name or trace ID, not span ID"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/pyroscope/troubleshooting/index.md",
