      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e6a5d68a03d9594afd6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The .NET CLR allows only one profiler to attach to a process at a time. The Pyroscope .NET profiler and OpenTelemetry auto-instrumentation each rely on a separate CLR profiler, so they conflict.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Pyroscope data source issues",
        "Trace to profiles issues",
        ".NET profiler conflict with OpenTelemetry auto-instrumentation"
      ],
