      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure the data source using either the data source interface in Grafana or using a configuration file. This page explains how to connect Grafana to Tempo, set up authentication, and enable streaming. For trace correlation features, provisioning, and other settings, refer to the linked sub-pages.",
