    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a276d06df5a8ca453bd7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Connecting to Grafana Cloud Traces:** Select **Basic authentication**. Use your Grafana Cloud stack's instance ID (shown in the Tempo data source URL on the Cloud Portal) as the **User**, and a Cloud Access Policy token with `traces:read` scope as the **Password**. Don't use your Grafana login credentials.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Tempo data source",
        "Authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/_index.md",
