      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **\\_\\_tags**           | This variable uses the tag mapping from the UI to create a label matcher string in the specific data source syntax. The variable only uses tags that are present in the span. The link is still created even if only one of those tags is present in the span. You can use this if all tags are not required for the query to be useful. |",
