    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.31be452df374c7740a11",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You must link a Prometheus data source in the **Data source** setting for the [Service Graph](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/service-graph/) to display data. Without this, Service Graph queries return empty results.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Additional settings",
        "Service graph"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "09071c2fb3df5f5165627db1f3c68a2f273f8bb1",
        "sha256": "795136a1fde6cbe46edb0308c477d3c0165fcbd99e5c684a2cb0e729b1bc4ea5",
        "lineStart": 49,
        "lineEnd": 49,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings.md#L49-L49"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d5397997d4a059d05296",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The linked Prometheus data source must contain metrics generated by [Grafana Alloy](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/configuration/grafana-alloy/) or the [Tempo metrics generator](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/metrics-generator/service_graphs/#tempo). For the full list of prerequisites and troubleshooting steps, refer to [Service Graph and Service Graph view](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/service-graph/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Additional settings",
        "Service graph"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "09071c2fb3df5f5165627db1f3c68a2f273f8bb1",
        "sha256": "795136a1fde6cbe46edb0308c477d3c0165fcbd99e5c684a2cb0e729b1bc4ea5",
        "lineStart": 51,
        "lineEnd": 51,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings.md#L51-L51"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ba2f3334f626139e26e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you cloned a provisioned data source (for example, the Grafana Cloud Traces data source) and the **Service graph** section doesn't appear in the cloned data source's settings, verify that the cloned data source has the same Tempo backend URL and authentication configured. The Service graph section only appears when the data source can connect to Tempo successfully. Refer to [Clone a provisioned data source for Grafana Cloud](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/provision/#clone-a-provisioned-data-source-for-grafana-cloud) for setup steps.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Additional settings",
        "Service graph"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "09071c2fb3df5f5165627db1f3c68a2f273f8bb1",
