    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f8425c82dab155ef80ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Node graph** setting enables the [node graph visualization](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/), which isn't activated by default.",
