    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c748f13467dde1dd44a4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Trace to logs correlation lets you navigate from a span in Tempo directly to the matching logs in Loki, and from a log line in Loki back to its trace in Tempo. When configured, a **Logs for this span** link appears in the trace view and a link to the configured tracing data source appears on log lines that contain a trace ID.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure trace to logs correlation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md",
