    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.83fb5a3eeebb322c952a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Configure **Tags** to map span attributes to Loki label names.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure trace to logs correlation",
        "Configure the Tempo data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "79b27dac6a84e3f457842a932b3a17ddb32c8024",
        "sha256": "4d7afd408b01ca0c2aa1c730ba09ae552d1706bd6b64758bccbbe6576f533f78",
        "lineStart": 66,
        "lineEnd": 66,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md#L66-L66"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53e7a36a658dbdb3a88f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana uses these tags to filter logs to the correct service, Pod, or cluster. The Loki label name you enter must exactly match the label name on your Loki streams. A mismatch silently breaks the correlation with no error shown.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure trace to logs correlation",
        "Configure the Tempo data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "79b27dac6a84e3f457842a932b3a17ddb32c8024",
        "sha256": "4d7afd408b01ca0c2aa1c730ba09ae552d1706bd6b64758bccbbe6576f533f78",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md#L68-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e21982ed00d0c02a1910",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you don't configure any tags, Grafana uses the following defaults: `cluster`, `hostname`, `namespace`, `pod`, `service.name` (remapped to `service_name`), and `service.namespace` (remapped to `service_namespace`). The automatic dot-to-underscore remapping only applies to these default tags. For custom tags, you must specify the remapped name explicitly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure trace to logs correlation",
        "Configure the Tempo data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "79b27dac6a84e3f457842a932b3a17ddb32c8024",
        "sha256": "4d7afd408b01ca0c2aa1c730ba09ae552d1706bd6b64758bccbbe6576f533f78",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs.md#L72-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
