    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a1c4447aa58e0fe30012",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To customize the mapping, use the **Add tag** button to add each row. The following table shows common tags and their typical Loki label equivalents:",
