      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a tag like `pod` is stored as Loki [structured metadata](https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/get-started/labels/structured-metadata/) instead of an indexed label, it can't appear in the stream selector `{}`. Move it to a pipeline filter instead:",
