      "id": "grafana.candidate.b1784c178d86619f05aa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your applications use different trace ID field names, you need a separate derived field entry for each format. To simplify this, standardize on OpenTelemetry structured metadata so trace IDs are stored as a consistent label.",
