    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d41ab26d948776f96774",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Span start time shift** | Shifts the start time for the metrics query, based on the span's start time. You can use time units, such as `5s`, `1m`, `3h`. To extend the time to the past, use a negative value. Default: `-2m`.                                                            |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure trace to metrics correlation",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
