    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.55b49e779427c65d1df1",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Tags**                  | Defines the tags used in linked queries. The key sets the span attribute name, and the optional value sets the corresponding metric label name. For example, you can map `k8s.pod` to `pod`. To interpolate these tags into queries, use the `$__tags` keyword. |",
      "headingPath": [
