      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If trace to metrics links aren't appearing or return no data, refer to [Trace to logs/metrics/profiles issues](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/#trace-to-logsmetricsprofiles-issues) in the troubleshooting guide.",
