    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f78b3fafff899056f95f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can't modify a provisioned data source from the Grafana UI. If you're using Grafana Cloud Traces (the pre-configured tracing data source in Grafana Cloud), its settings are read-only. To configure trace to profiles, [clone the data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/provision/#clone-a-provisioned-data-source-for-grafana-cloud) to create an editable copy, or update the provisioning file for self-managed instances. Refer to the [Provisioning](#provisioning) section for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure trace to profiles correlation",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-profiles.md",
