      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can provision the trace to profiles configuration using the `tracesToProfiles` block in your data source YAML file. For the full provisioning YAML example including all Tempo settings, refer to [Provision the Tempo data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/provision/).",
