      "sourceText": "If trace to profiles links aren't appearing or the flame graph is empty, refer to [Trace to logs/metrics/profiles issues](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/#trace-to-logsmetricsprofiles-issues) in the troubleshooting guide. For additional diagnosis steps, refer to [Troubleshoot trace to profiles](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-client/trace-span-profiles/) in the Pyroscope documentation.",
