      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use Grafana [correlations](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/correlations/) to embed interactive correlation links in your trace view to jump from spans to related logs, metrics, profiles, or external systems. This guide explains how to configure and manage Trace correlations in Grafana.",
