    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.08332a0487b3844aba10",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Before running queries, verify that your Tempo data source is configured and connected. If queries return no results or errors, refer to [Configure the Tempo data source](../configure-tempo-data-source/) to check your connection and authentication settings.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query tracing data",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d808fd736f68dd2ce682856b4d35c09f6112e32",
        "sha256": "e9e0dc96d5fb0a015ff14ee389f5e3ce8b9f32d4fe29ff7e3595a2c9eb4aabe8",
        "lineStart": 39,
        "lineEnd": 40,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md#L39-L40"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b9c89a1abf9424b144e2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You don't have to know TraceQL to create a query. The **Search** query builder lets you select options from drop-down lists to build a query visually. These selections generate a TraceQL query that you can transfer to the **TraceQL** editor to refine further.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query tracing data",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d808fd736f68dd2ce682856b4d35c09f6112e32",
        "sha256": "e9e0dc96d5fb0a015ff14ee389f5e3ce8b9f32d4fe29ff7e3595a2c9eb4aabe8",
        "lineStart": 43,
        "lineEnd": 45,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md#L43-L45"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e023f158b1edd7ecd4d2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "TraceQL queries follow the pattern `{ conditions } | pipeline`, where conditions inside `{}` select spans and pipeline operators like `count()` or `avg()` aggregate results. To learn the full syntax, refer to [Construct a TraceQL query](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/traceql/construct-traceql-queries/). For a language overview, refer to the [TraceQL documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/traceql).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query tracing data",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d808fd736f68dd2ce682856b4d35c09f6112e32",
        "sha256": "e9e0dc96d5fb0a015ff14ee389f5e3ce8b9f32d4fe29ff7e3595a2c9eb4aabe8",
        "lineStart": 47,
        "lineEnd": 49,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md#L47-L49"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b92e3265e3704123eef1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The query editor has three **Query types** that you can use to explore your tracing data. You can use these modes by themselves or in combination to create building blocks to generate custom queries. Adding another query adds a new query block. Refer to [Use query types together](#use-query-types-together) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query tracing data",
        "Choose a query editing mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md",
