    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.63fbab56779b523e5e41",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Start here if you're exploring data or learning TraceQL. The **Search** query builder provides drop-down lists and text fields to build a query visually without needing to know TraceQL syntax. Your selections automatically generate a TraceQL query that you can copy to the editor for further refinement.",
