    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8366aa30f3fb996df8b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Tempo search is non-deterministic. When you run a search, Tempo performs a massively parallel scan over the selected time range and returns the first N matching results. Even identical searches can return different results due to variations in machine load and network latency.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query tracing data",
        "Understand search behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d808fd736f68dd2ce682856b4d35c09f6112e32",
        "sha256": "e9e0dc96d5fb0a015ff14ee389f5e3ce8b9f32d4fe29ff7e3595a2c9eb4aabe8",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cf8b0f3af26180c782b6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This design prioritizes speed over predictability. To make results deterministic, append a `with` clause to your TraceQL queries, for example `{ status = error } with (most_recent=true)`, so Tempo returns the most recent matching traces. For more information, refer to [Retrieve most recent results](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/traceql/#retrieve-most-recent-results).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query tracing data",
        "Understand search behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/query-editor/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d808fd736f68dd2ce682856b4d35c09f6112e32",
        "sha256": "e9e0dc96d5fb0a015ff14ee389f5e3ce8b9f32d4fe29ff7e3595a2c9eb4aabe8",
        "lineStart": 101,
        "lineEnd": 101,
