      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Streaming : Indicates if streaming is active. Streaming lets you view partial query results before the entire query completes. Activating streaming adds the **Table - Streaming Progress** section to the query results.",
      "headingPath": [
