      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use **+ Add query** to create customized queries that use one or more of the query types together. Each time you add a new query, it adds a new section, or query block, that contains **Search**, **TraceQL**, or **Service Graph** user interface.",
      "headingPath": [
