      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These span metrics must be present in your linked Prometheus data source. Span metrics generation must be enabled in your Tempo or Alloy configuration. Refer to [Enable service graphs](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/metrics-from-traces/service_graphs/enable-service-graphs/) in the Tempo documentation.",
