      "sourceText": "You can also use TraceQL to query the same data programmatically. Refer to [TraceQL query examples](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/query-editor/traceql-query-examples/) to translate Service Graph observations into queries.",
