      "sourceText": "If the Service Graph isn't displaying data, the table is empty, or you see high cardinality warnings, refer to [Service graph issues](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/#service-graph-issues) in the troubleshooting guide.",
