      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Grafana can't reach the Tempo instance. This typically means the Tempo process isn't running, the URL in the data source settings is wrong, or a network-level rule is blocking the connection.",
