      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb80120f9835f99a47a8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The authentication credentials are invalid or the user doesn't have permission to access Tempo. This error appears when you select **Save & test** or when running a query.",
