    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0052ceaa8789a825860b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The Grafana health check reaches the server but the `api/echo` endpoint returns a 404. The most common cause is incorrect path segments in the URL (such as `/api` or `/tempo` on a self-managed instance) that shift the health check request to a nonexistent path. A 404 can also occur when a reverse proxy in front of Tempo rejects requests that include unexpected basic authentication headers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "Save and test returns 404"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.864f8ccd50f82baf9f62",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify that the URL doesn't include trailing path segments. For self-managed Tempo, the URL should be `http://<HOST>:3200` with no path. Refer to the [Connection](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/) section for the correct format.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "Save and test returns 404"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
