    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ed4ab63c4ee434a4c2e3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The tenant ID (`X-Scope-OrgID` header) is missing or incorrect. This header must be set on both the write path (in your Alloy or OpenTelemetry Collector configuration) and the read path (in the Grafana data source settings) to route data to the correct tenant.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "Multi-tenant authentication issues"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
