      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c12eac70047b8276a534",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In the Tempo data source settings, verify that the `X-Scope-OrgID` header is configured under **Authentication > HTTP Headers**. Refer to [Multi-tenancy](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/) for data source configuration steps.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "Multi-tenant authentication issues"
      ],
