      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Try [Grafana Traces Drilldown](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/simplified-exploration/traces/), a queryless app that lets you explore tracing data using RED metrics without writing TraceQL.",
