    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.58cb8a4659ed306650a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** **Save & test** succeeds, but running queries in Explore returns no traces. The data source connection is valid, but no trace data is reaching Tempo, or the queries don't match any ingested data.",
