      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify that your applications are instrumented and that your collector (Alloy, OpenTelemetry Collector) is forwarding spans to Tempo. Check collector logs for send errors, rejected spans, or drops.",
      "headingPath": [
