      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For multi-tenant setups, verify that the `X-Scope-OrgID` header is the same on both the write path (collector) and the read path (Grafana data source). A mismatch causes traces to be ingested under one tenant and queried under another.",
