    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.280a81a9eae1b30a89a5",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If you need aggregate data (rates, counts, durations) rather than individual traces, consider using [TraceQL metrics queries](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/traceql/metrics-queries/) (for example, `{ } | rate()`) or pre-computed metrics from the [metrics generator](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/metrics-generator/), which are optimized for aggregate workloads.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "Query timeout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
