    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ee90acf47ef304e9ab86",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** TraceQL metrics queries (such as `{ } | rate()` or `{ } | count_over_time()`) require the `local-blocks` processor to be active in the Tempo metrics-generator configuration. This processor is separate from the `service-graphs` and `span-metrics` processors and must be enabled independently.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "TraceQL metrics query fails"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 238,
        "lineEnd": 238,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L238-L238"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0f7bf782c7e9a6dbbd98",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For self-managed Tempo, activate the `local-blocks` processor in the overrides configuration. The configuration path depends on your Tempo version and deployment method:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "TraceQL metrics query fails"
