    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef66d134cafb6f167e85",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For self-managed Tempo, verify that you're using the required Tempo version (v2.2 or later for search streaming, v2.7 or later for metrics streaming) and that streaming is enabled in your configuration (`stream_over_http_enabled: true`). Refer to [Tempo gRPC API](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/api_docs/#tempo-grpc-api) in the Tempo documentation. Streaming is available for Grafana Cloud users by default.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Streaming issues",
        "Streaming not working"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 263,
        "lineEnd": 263,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L263-L263"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.37cd7101d7eb1fb9b3cb",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify that **Streaming** is enabled in your [Tempo data source settings](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/#streaming). The **Search queries** and **Metrics queries** toggles are independent—check that the toggle for the query type you're using is enabled.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Streaming issues",
        "Streaming not working"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 264,
        "lineEnd": 264,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L264-L264"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e2e0dc29f4f6eeb849bd",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If your Tempo instance is behind a load balancer or proxy that doesn't support gRPC or HTTP2, streaming may not work. Disable streaming and use standard HTTP queries instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Streaming issues",
        "Streaming not working"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
