    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.778a5e2e3b8cef0640f2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** Grafana tries to use gRPC over an insecure (non-TLS) connection. Streaming uses gRPC, which may require TLS depending on your Tempo configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Streaming issues",
