      "sourceText": "1. For Grafana Cloud Traces users, refer to [Troubleshoot service graph and RED metrics](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/send-data/traces/troubleshoot/#troubleshoot-service-graph-and-red-metrics).",
