      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These issues relate to the correlation features that link traces to other telemetry signals. For configuration details, refer to [Trace to logs](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-logs/), [Trace to metrics](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-metrics/), and [Trace to profiles](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/configure-trace-to-profiles/).",
