      "id": "grafana.candidate.60f9aec11c30deeb94df",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Check that the tag mappings correctly translate attribute names between data sources. Span attributes use dots (for example, `service.name`) but Loki labels use underscores (for example, `service_name`). Ensure tag mappings account for this difference. Refer to [Trace to logs](ref:trace-to-logs) for tag mapping configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Trace to logs/metrics/profiles issues",
        "Links appear but return no data"
      ],
      "source": {
