    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ffa12268a4a45df2063",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If a tag like `pod` is stored as Loki [structured metadata](https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/get-started/labels/structured-metadata/) rather than an indexed label, the auto-generated stream selector `{pod=\"...\"}` returns no results. Enable **Use custom query** and move the tag to a pipeline filter. Refer to [Trace to logs](ref:trace-to-logs) for a custom query example.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Trace to logs/metrics/profiles issues",
        "Links appear but return no data"
      ],
