    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.15a971ab2a41a9e17db0",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify that **Node graph** is enabled in the Tempo data source settings under [Additional settings](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Node graph not displaying"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
