    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4725ae69990208d6f0e3",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Check that the trace contains multiple spans with parent-child relationships. Spans must include `traceID` and `spanID`, and non-root spans must include `parentSpanID` to establish hierarchy. If these identifiers are missing, the trace data is incomplete at the instrumentation level and the graph can't be rendered.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Node graph not displaying"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
