    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.21e6ba8d3dd81f1598fc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** The TraceQL editor doesn't show suggestions for attributes or values. Autocomplete requires Tempo to enumerate tags, which requires a supported storage backend (`vParquet` or later).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Autocomplete not working"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 453,
        "lineEnd": 453,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L453-L453"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e480e87956ff9b2d6e46",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For self-managed Tempo, verify that the storage backend supports tag search. Tempo requires `vParquet` format or later for tag-based search and autocomplete. Refer to [Parquet configuration](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/configuration/parquet/) for details. Grafana Cloud Traces supports autocomplete by default.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Autocomplete not working"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 457,
        "lineEnd": 457,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L457-L457"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b0a9c604e2df05ebe200",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Check the **Tags time range** setting in the [data source settings](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/additional-settings/) to ensure it covers a period with recent trace data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Autocomplete not working"
      ],
      "source": {
