    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9c53c1b249d07cc51aea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** You configured settings in the Grafana UI (such as trace-to-logs links, service graph, or span time shifts), but they disappear after Grafana restarts. This happens when the data source is provisioned via a YAML configuration file, Helm chart, or Terraform. Provisioned data sources are read-only in the UI—any changes you make through the UI aren't persisted and silently revert on the next restart.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Data source settings disappear after restart"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
