    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e19f67058b4ed24d2fa1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can tell a data source is provisioned if the settings form is read-only and the button reads **Test** instead of **Save & test**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Data source settings disappear after restart"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
