    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fe7a257d332fc9e62e7d",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. To change settings permanently, edit the provisioning YAML file and restart Grafana (or wait for the provisioning system to reload). Any setting available in the UI can be set in the YAML file, including trace-to-logs, trace-to-metrics, and service graph configuration. Refer to [Provision the Tempo data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/provision/) for the full YAML reference.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Data source settings disappear after restart"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 470,
        "lineEnd": 470,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L470-L470"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.59de848604cd08e16577",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For Grafana Cloud, you can clone the provisioned data source to create an editable copy that persists UI changes. Refer to [Clone a provisioned data source for Grafana Cloud](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/provision/#clone-a-provisioned-data-source-for-grafana-cloud) for the steps.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Data source settings disappear after restart"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 471,
        "lineEnd": 471,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L471-L471"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8327cfb8c6dcfdbb666",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** You can select the Tempo data source in the Grafana Alerting rule builder, but standard TraceQL search queries return trace data (spans and trace IDs), not numeric time series. Alert rules require numeric data to evaluate thresholds, so trace search queries don't produce usable alert conditions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "TraceQL alerting not available"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 475,
        "lineEnd": 475,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L475-L475"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e16540923fae198597e7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "TraceQL metrics queries (such as `{ } | rate()` or `{ status = error } | count_over_time()`) return numeric time series and can drive alert thresholds directly. However, TraceQL alerting requires the experimental `tempoAlerting` feature flag, which is disabled by default. To enable it, set the [`tempoAlerting` feature flag](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#feature_toggles) in your Grafana configuration. For Grafana Cloud, contact Support to enable it. For step-by-step setup, refer to [Trace-based alerts](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/examples/trace-based-alerts/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "TraceQL alerting not available"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 479,
        "lineEnd": 479,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L479-L479"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0242406bfb386509acdf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alternatively, use the Tempo metrics generator to produce Prometheus metrics from trace data, then create alert rules against the Prometheus data source that stores those metrics.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "TraceQL alerting not available"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 485,
        "lineEnd": 485,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L485-L485"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.14086558b259762c540d",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Configure the Tempo [metrics generator](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/metrics-generator/) (using the `service-graphs`, `span-metrics`, or `local-blocks` processor) to produce metrics from traces and remote-write them to a Prometheus-compatible backend.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "TraceQL alerting not available"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 487,
        "lineEnd": 487,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L487-L487"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b3a8bca7ae9b75952ce9",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Create alert rules against the Prometheus data source that receives those metrics. For example, alert on high error rates using `traces_spanmetrics_calls_total` with a `status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"` filter.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "TraceQL alerting not available"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "39a0f51bf9a95c054012e8ed995cf2c0797a1612",
        "sha256": "b97dd910b1438c85619e78e14dab20742021cf67c5f6c0df2539d7852eedcfb5",
        "lineStart": 488,
        "lineEnd": 488,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md#L488-L488"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
