      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e5b88c65073fb585af9e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In dashboards, create a [data source template variable](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/variables/add-template-variables/#add-a-data-source-variable) filtered to `tempo` type. This adds a dropdown that lets viewers switch between Tempo instances without editing the dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Other common issues",
        "Switching between multiple Tempo instances"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
