    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc64aed82693f1fccc92",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These issues relate to connecting to a private Tempo instance using Private data source connect (PDC). PDC is only available in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Private data source connect issues (_Grafana Cloud only_)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
