    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.40b4f612cf02c35af4b2",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify the PDC agent is running in your private network.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Tempo data source issues",
        "Private data source connect issues (_Grafana Cloud only_)",
        "PDC agent not connected"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/tempo/troubleshooting/index.md",
