      "sourceText": "You can define and configure the data source in YAML files as part of Grafana's provisioning system. For more information about provisioning, refer to [Provisioning data sources](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/provisioning/#data-sources).",
