    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b6520f6f8e2000aca6a2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead of a traditional query language, the TestData data source uses **scenarios** to generate simulated data. Each scenario produces a different type of data suited for testing specific visualizations, behaviors, or edge cases. TestData includes 30 scenarios covering time series, logs, traces, graphs, streaming, and error simulation.",
